wire="modal.querySelector('#shortcutsBtn').onclick=()=>showShortcuts();"
wire_new="modal.querySelector('#shortcutsBtn').onclick=()=>showShortcuts();modal.querySelector('#calendarEventsBtn').onclick=()=>openEventManager();modal.querySelector('#emailIdentityGuideBtn').onclick=()=>openModal('Email profile image',`<div class=\"identity-guide\"><div class=\"sender-identity-card\"><img src=\"https://frankiflow.de/assets/frankiflow-logo.png\" alt=\"FrankiFlow\"><div><strong>Recipient-facing FrankiFlow avatar</strong><small>FrankiFlow Mail can prepare the identity, but Gmail/Outlook decide whether an external sender logo is displayed.</small></div></div><p>For supported providers, the next production step is to verify strong email authentication (SPF, DKIM and DMARC) and publish compatible brand identity/BIMI records using the approved FrankiFlow logo. Some providers may require a verified mark certificate.</p><p class=\"muted\">This is intentionally separated from email signatures: a signature logo appears inside the message, while a sender avatar appears beside the message in the recipient's mailbox.</p></div>`,null);"
